  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "After losing her father, Mizuka is taken in by her uncle and moves to Kagozaki, known as the \"Dragon People Town,\" where she meets a boy named Tenshin, who also lives in her uncle's house. She tries to get closer to him, but he remains cold and distant. Could the fact that people call him a \"human dragon\" have anything to do with that?\n\n(Source: Lilac Scans)"
